ummary><p class="faq-answer">A budget humidifier can be enough for a small bedroom, but the tradeoff is usually smaller tank capacity, more frequent refilling, and weaker long-term ownership confidence.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>How often should a humidifier be cleaned?</summary><p class="faq-answer">A humidifier should be cleaned regularly because standing water and hidden crevices can develop slime or mineral buildup. If cleaning feels difficult, the humidifier is more likely to become a regret purchase.</p></details>
